---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Projects: 프로젝트 포트폴리오"
  description="pargame 프로젝트 포트폴리오 — UE 5.9 C++ 「곰팡이 우주 정복 대작전」 완성 케이스 스터디"
>
  <div class="note-header">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="브레드크럼">
      <a href="/learn">Study Notes</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <a href="/learn">Labs &amp; Projects</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="current">Project</span>
    </nav>

    <div class="topic-tag">LABS &amp; PROJECTS // PORTFOLIO</div>
    <h1>Projects: 프로젝트 포트폴리오</h1>
    <p class="topic-desc">
      이론 스터디에서 검증한 C++ 메모리·수명주기 모델, 게임 엔진 아키텍처, 셰이더 및 VFX 파이프라인을 실제 작동하는 프로토타입과 게임으로 구현하며 남기는 엔지니어링 허브입니다.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="projects-section">
    <div class="section-title-wrap">
      <span class="badge">FEATURED CASE STUDY</span>
      <h2>완성 프로젝트</h2>
      <p>1분 요약으로 핵심 성과를 확인하고, 각 카드에서 딥다이브 장으로 바로 이동할 수 있습니다.</p>
    </div>

    <article class="project-showcase">
      <div class="showcase-top">
        <div class="showcase-badges">
          <span class="status-pill completed">
            <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
            COMPLETED · UE 5.9 (macOS / Windows)
          </span>
          <span class="path-pill">C++ · 10-Hunt Time Attack</span>
        </div>
        <span class="updated-meta">Updated 2026. 11. 19</span>
      </div>

      <div class="showcase-body">
        <div class="showcase-copy">
          <h2>
            <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest">
              곰팡이 우주 정복 대작전
            </a>
          </h2>
          <p class="project-subtitle">
            무중력 우주에서 균류 세포로 성장하며 <strong>포식자 곰팡이 10마리를 최단 시간 안에 역포식</strong>하는 UE 5.9 C++ 미니게임. 처치 2마리에 <strong>V2 광역 그물</strong>, 5마리에 <strong>V3 긴급 탈출</strong>이 해금되고, 포식자는 <strong>공격 티켓 · 포위 링 AI</strong>로 압박합니다. 클리어 타임은 로컬 <strong>TOP 5 리더보드</strong>에 기록됩니다.
          </p>

          <div class="metrics-strip">
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-label">ARCHITECTURE</span>
              <span class="metric-value">0-Tick OOP</span>
              <span class="metric-desc">UInterface 의존성 역전 · EditInlineNew 능력 객체</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-label">WORLD STREAMING</span>
              <span class="metric-value">1,150 Asteroids · 2-Tier</span>
              <span class="metric-desc">근거리 48 Chaos / 원거리 Kinematic · 크기 비례 0ms 스케일링</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-label">GAMEPLAY AI</span>
              <span class="metric-value">Attack Ticket AI · 10-Hunt</span>
              <span class="metric-desc">최대 2마리 돌진 · 포위 링 · 최대 도달 크기 스폰</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-label">OPTIMIZATION &amp; PIPELINE</span>
              <span class="metric-value">M4 21.4GB → 7.93GB · UE 5.9 MCP</span>
              <span class="metric-desc">공식 MCP 베타 실전 검증 · 멀티 에이전트 가드레일</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="stack-tags">
            <span class="stack-tag">#UE5_9</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#AttackTicketAI</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#ZeroTickAbilityOOP</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#UInterface</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#TwoTierChaosPhysics</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#RuntimeSizeScale</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#PureSlateHUD</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#M4_16GB_Optimization</span>
            <span class="stack-tag">#UE59_OfficialMCP</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest"
          class="showcase-preview"
          aria-label="곰팡이 우주 정복 대작전 케이스 스터디 열기"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/projects/fungal-space-conquest/blog-pie-idle.png"
            alt="UE 5.9 Lvl_Main 우주 공간에서 부유 중인 곰팡이 우주 정복 대작전 BP_SpaceDrifterPawn PIE 뷰포트"
            loading="eager"
          />
          <span class="preview-caption">PIE Capture (1920×1080) · Lvl_Main + BP_SpaceDrifterPawn</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="milestone-strip">
        <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest#gameplay-ai" class="milestone-card">
          <div class="m-top">
            <span class="m-num">CHAPTER 01</span>
            <span class="m-arrow">➔</span>
          </div>
          <h3>게임플레이 &amp; 포식자 AI</h3>
          <p>10마리 타임어택 루프, 공격 티켓(최대 2마리)·포위 링·최소 이격, 순수 Slate HUD &amp; TOP 5</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest#tendrils" class="milestone-card">
          <div class="m-top">
            <span class="m-num">CHAPTER 02</span>
            <span class="m-arrow">➔</span>
          </div>
          <h3>무중력 본체 &amp; 다형성 촉수</h3>
          <p><code>ISpaceTendrilHostInterface</code> · <code>ISpaceColonizableTarget</code>, V1 길이 비례 인력, V2/V3 처치 해금</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest#world-streaming" class="milestone-card">
          <div class="m-top">
            <span class="m-num">CHAPTER 03</span>
            <span class="m-arrow">➔</span>
          </div>
          <h3>소행성 1,150 풀 &amp; 월드 스트리밍</h3>
          <p>2-Tier 물리, 구형 껍질 C=[A,B], <code>RuntimeSizeScale</code> 0ms 균일 스케일링, 이중 미네랄</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest#optimization" class="milestone-card">
          <div class="m-top">
            <span class="m-num">CHAPTER 04</span>
            <span class="m-arrow">➔</span>
          </div>
          <h3>최적화 &amp; Windows 이식</h3>
          <p>천구 <code>MPC</code>, M4 16GB <code>21.4GB → 7.93GB</code>, MSVC C2397 수정 &amp; 1.08 MB 퍼블릭 리포</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest#pipeline" class="milestone-card">
          <div class="m-top">
            <span class="m-num">CHAPTER 05</span>
            <span class="m-arrow">➔</span>
          </div>
          <h3>개발 파이프라인 &amp; AI 가드레일</h3>
          <p><code>ue-on/off</code> 격리, UE 5.9 공식 MCP 베타 검증, <code>ARCHITECTURE.md</code> 멀티 에이전트 규약</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="showcase-footer">
        <div class="footer-note">
          "구현은 AI가, 설계는 인간이" — 모든 코드 스니펫은 공개 리포지토리의 최신 UE 5.9 C++ 소스와 동일합니다.
        </div>
        <div class="footer-actions">
          <a href="https://github.com/pargame/FungalSpaceConquest" class="cta-btn secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            GitHub ↗
          </a>
          <a href="/learn/labs/project/fungal-space-conquest" class="cta-btn">
            케이스 스터디 읽기 →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .note-header {
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--text-2);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .breadcrumb .current {
    color: var(--accent-2);
  }
  .topic-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .note-header h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 1.5rem + 1.5vw, 2.6rem);
  }
  .topic-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .projects-section {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .section-title-wrap {
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }
  .section-title-wrap .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .section-title-wrap h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
  }
  .section-title-wrap p {
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .project-showcase {
    background: var(--surface-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.8rem;
  }
  .showcase-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .showcase-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .status-pill,
  .engine-pill,
  .path-pill {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.28rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .status-pill.completed {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--success);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--success) 12%, transparent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--success) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .pulse-dot {
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--success);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--success);
  }
  .engine-pill {
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-muted);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 30%, transparent);
  }
  .path-pill {
    color: var(--text-2);
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }
  .updated-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .showcase-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .showcase-copy h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.3rem + 0.8vw, 2rem);
  }
  .showcase-copy h2 a {
    color: var(--text-1);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .showcase-copy h2 a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .project-subtitle {
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }
  .project-subtitle strong {
    color: var(--text-1);
  }

  .metrics-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
  }
  .metric-item {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }
  .metric-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .metric-value {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }
  .metric-desc {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .stack-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }
  .stack-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    color: var(--accent-2);
  }

  .showcase-preview {
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--code-bg);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform var(--dur), border-color var(--dur), box-shadow var(--dur);
  }
  .showcase-preview:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: var(--glow);
  }
  .showcase-preview img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .preview-caption {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .milestone-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .milestone-card {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    transition: all var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .milestone-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .m-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m-arrow {
    color: var(--text-3);
    transition: transform var(--dur-fast), color var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .milestone-card:hover .m-arrow {
    color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }
  .milestone-card h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }
  .milestone-card p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .showcase-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .footer-note {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.35rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--text-inverse);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .footer-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }
  .cta-btn.secondary {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    color: var(--text-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .cta-btn.secondary:hover {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: none;
  }
  .cta-btn:hover {
    background: var(--accent-strong);
    color: var(--text-inverse);
    box-shadow: var(--glow);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .showcase-body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .project-showcase {
      padding: 1.3rem;
    }
    .metrics-strip {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
